{"seq":2,"slug":"workflow-tool-integration","title":"工作流集成：把 Agent 接进既有工具链","stage":"DONE","category":"bridges","categoryLabel":"Bridges · 跨 Tier 协同","chapterCount":2,"docCount":6,"url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/workflow-tool-integration","rating":{"composite":3.7,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":2.5,"strategic":4.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"真实的 agent 不活在真空里——它要接进你既有的项目管理、聊天、文档与日历工具链。本模块沉淀把 agent 桥接进工作流的三类基础模式（工具桥、事件触发、双向同步），并给出 Linear/Jira、Slack/飞书、文档与日历三个工具族的实战配方。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"integration-patterns","title":"Integration Patterns","docCount":3,"url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/workflow-tool-integration/integration-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agent-to-tool-bridges","title":"Agent 到工具的桥接方式","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/workflow-tool-integration/integration-patterns/agent-to-tool-bridges","wordCount":2426,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"event-driven-triggers","title":"事件驱动的触发","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/workflow-tool-integration/integration-patterns/event-driven-triggers","wordCount":2485,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"bidirectional-sync","title":"双向同步与状态一致","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/workflow-tool-integration/integration-patterns/bidirectional-sync","wordCount":2648,"readingTime":11}],"introMarkdown":"把 agent 桥接进既有工作流，归根结底只有三类基础模式：让 agent 触达工具的「工具桥」、让事件代替人来唤起 agent 的「事件触发」、以及 agent 与外部系统互相读写时的「双向同步」。本章逐一拆解这三类模式的通道选择、运行纪律与状态一致性问题，并给出个人尺度下可直接照搬的配方。理解这三块之后，任何新工具的接入都只是模式的重新组合。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"practical-recipes","title":"Practical Recipes","docCount":3,"url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/workflow-tool-integration/practical-recipes","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pm-tools-linear-jira","title":"项目管理工具集成（Linear/Jira 类）","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/workflow-tool-integration/practical-recipes/pm-tools-linear-jira","wordCount":2309,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"chat-ops-slack-lark","title":"聊天协作集成（Slack/飞书类）","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/workflow-tool-integration/practical-recipes/chat-ops-slack-lark","wordCount":2379,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"docs-calendar-automation","title":"文档与日历自动化","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/workflow-tool-integration/practical-recipes/docs-calendar-automation","wordCount":2378,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"前面讲过的集成模式终究要落到你每天打开的那几个工具上。本章给出三类高频工具族的具体配方：项目管理工具（Linear/Jira 类）、聊天协作平台（Slack/飞书类）、以及文档与日历自动化。每篇都按「高价值场景、接入通道、确认门槛、防噪声规则」的结构展开，可以直接照着搭，也可以作为你接入其他同类工具时的参照模板。\n"}]}